  help: Variable `someGlobal` is declared outside of the component/hook. Reassigning this value during render is a side effect which can cause unpredictable behavior. If this variable is used in rendering, use useState instead. Otherwise, update it in an effect
  note: React Compiler skipped optimizing this component or hook. Additional guidance: https://react.dev/reference/eslint-plugin-react-hooks/lints/globals
